ational", "ref_id": "NCT05168774"}, {"study_label": "Elamipretide Ph1/2 (Ph2)", "outcome": "activity (vision loss; no posted results; pipeline only)", "arm": "mito", "direction": "unclear", "significant": false, "evidence": "observational", "ref_id": "NCT05168774"}, {"study_label": "Elamipretide confirmatory RCT (Ph4)", "outcome": "knee extensor muscle strength (no posted results; pipeline only)", "arm": "mito", "direction": "unclear", "significant": false, "evidence": "rct", "ref_id": "NCT07531251"}, {"study_label": "Elamipretide pivotal RCT (Ph3)", "outcome": "efficacy (no posted results; pipeline only)", "arm": "mito", "direction": "unclear", "significant": false, "evidence": "rct", "ref_id": "NCT05162768"}, {"study_label": "Elamipretide pivotal RCT (Ph3)", "outcome": "safety (no posted results; pipeline only)", "arm": "mito", "direction": "unclear", "significant": false, "evidence": "rct", "ref_id": "NCT05162768"}, {"study_label": "NFS-02 single-arm (Ph1)", "outcome": "safety and tolerability (no posted results; pipeline only)", "arm": "mito", "direction": "unclear", "significant": false, "evidence": "observational", "ref_id": "NCT05820152"}, {"study_label": "NFS-02 single-arm (Ph1)", "outcome": "visual acuity (no posted results; pipeline only)", "arm": "mito", "direction": "unclear", "significant": false, "evidence": "observational", "ref_id": "NCT05820152"}, {"study_label": "NR082 sham-controlled RCT (Ph3)", "outcome": "safety and efficacy (no posted results; pipeline only)", "arm": "mito", "direction": "unclear", "significant": false, "evidence": "rct", "ref_id": "NCT07406854"}, {"study_label": "NR082 single-arm (Ph2)", "outcome": "visual acuity (no posted results; pipeline only)", "arm": "mito", "direction": "unclear", "significant": false, "evidence": "observational", "ref_id": "NCT05293626"}, {"study_label": "NR082 single-arm (Ph2)", "outcome": "safety (no posted results; pipeline only)", "arm": "mito", "direction": "unclear", "significant": false, "evidence": "observational", "ref_id": "NCT05293626"}, {"study_label": "NR myopathy trial (Ph2)", "outcome": "adult-onset symptoms of mitochondrial myopathy (no posted results; pipeline only)", "arm": "mito", "direction": "unclear", "significant": false, "evidence": "observational", "ref_id": "NCT05590468"}, {"study_label": "NR CHF trial (Ph2)", "outcome": "cardiac dysfunction (no posted results; pipeline only)", "arm": "mito", "direction": "unclear", "significant": false, "evidence": "rct", "ref_id": "NCT05732051"}, {"study_label": "NR CHF trial (Ph2)", "outcome": "skeletal muscle injury (no posted results; pipeline only)", "arm": "mito", "direction": "unclear", "significant": false, "evidence": "rct", "ref_id": "NCT05732051"}, {"study_label": "NR CHF trial (Ph2)", "outcome": "functional capacity (no posted results; pipeline only)", "arm": "mito", "direction": "unclear", "significant": false, "evidence": "rct", "ref_id": "NCT05732051"}], "gap_cells": [{"intervention": "mitochondria-targeted strategies (class)", "disease": "primary mitochondrial diseases", "n_studies": 2, "top_evidence": "meta", "refs": ["41594657", "42782782"]}, {"intervention": "mitochondria-targeted assisted-reproduction therapies", "disease": "primary mitochondrial diseases", "n_studies": 1, "top_evidence": "meta", "refs": ["39066614"]}, {"intervention": "elamipretide", "disease": "primary mitochondrial diseases", "n_studies": 5, "top_evidence": "meta", "refs": ["42794697", "42415111", "NCT05168774", "NCT05162768", "NCT07531251"]}, {"intervention": "nicotinamide riboside (NR)", "disease": "primary mitochondrial diseases", "n_studies": 1, "top_evidence": "observational", "refs": ["NCT05590468"]}, {"intervention": "mitochondria-targeted agents in CHF (class-level)", "disease": "chronic heart failure", "n_studies": 5, "top_evidence": "meta", "refs": ["42495453", "42440741", "40845481", "41595638", "42273289"]}, {"intervention": "urolithin A", "disease": "chronic heart failure", "n_studies": 2, "top_evidence": "preclinical", "refs": ["42616901", "42432192"]}, {"intervention": "luteolin", "disease": "chronic heart failure", "n_studies": 1, "top_evidence": "preclinical", "refs": ["42013553"]}, {"intervention": "nicotinamide riboside (NR)", "disease": "chronic heart failure", "n_studies": 1, "top_evidence": "rct", "refs": ["NCT05732051"]}, {"intervention": "SkQ1", "disease": "Leber hereditary optic neuropathy", "n_studies": 1, "top_evidence": "preclinical", "refs": ["39335534"]}, {"intervention": "nicotinamide riboside (NR)", "disease": "Leber hereditary optic neuropathy", "n_studies": 1, "top_evidence": "preclinical", "refs": ["10.21203/rs.3.rs-8295635/v1"]}, {"intervention": "idebenone (standard of care)", "disease": "Leber hereditary optic neuropathy", "n_studies": 1, "top_evidence": "meta", "refs": ["42535808"]}, {"intervention": "rAAV2/2-ND4 gene therapy", "disease": "Leber hereditary optic neuropathy", "n_studies": 1, "top_evidence": "meta", "refs": ["42535808"]}, {"intervention": "NFS-02 (gene therapy)", "disease": "Leber hereditary optic neuropathy", "n_studies": 1, "top_evidence": "observational", "refs": ["NCT05820152"]}, {"intervention": "NR082", "disease": "Leber hereditary optic neuropathy", "n_studies": 2, "top_evidence": "rct", "refs": ["NCT07406854", "NCT05293626"]}, {"intervention": "methylene blue + MitoQ", "disease": "skeletal aging", "n_studies": 1, "top_evidence": "preclinical", "refs": ["38535998"]}, {"intervention": "elamipretide/antioxidant-redox therapies", "disease": "retinitis pigmentosa", "n_studies": 1, "top_evidence": "meta", "refs": ["42792149"]}, {"intervention": "NAD+ supplementation", "disease": "Parkinson's disease", "n_studies": 1, "top_evidence": "meta", "refs": ["42489969"]}, {"intervention": "mitochondria-targeted drugs (class)", "disease": "neurodegenerative diseases", "n_studies": 1, "top_evidence": "meta", "refs": ["41677699"]}, {"intervention": "Restorin NR", "disease": "aging", "n_studies": 1, "top_evidence": "preclinical", "refs": ["42582917"]}], "insights": ["Only one source gives significant quantitative human outcomes for mito-targeted therapy: a class-level meta-analysis in chronic heart failure reporting LVEF improvement vs control (SMD 0.42, 95% CI 0.31-0.53), NYHA class improvement (RR 2.38), reduced all-cause mortality (RR 0.62) and HF hospitalizations (RR 0.60); because it pools heterogeneous agents and its control is not a GDMT-matched standard-of-care arm, inconsistency + indirectness triggers apply - low confidence for a mechanism-specific causal claim (42440741).", "Elamipretide is the only mito-targeted agent with regulatory approval (muscle strength in Barth syndrome, significant in the meta-analysis), yet cardiac disease modification remains explicitly unconfirmed, and the pivotal and confirmatory RCTs (N=102, N=48) plus the Ph1/2 study have no posted results - efficacy beyond muscle strength is currently unproven (42794697; NCT05162768; NCT07531251; NCT05168774).", "Head-to-head mito vs standard-of-care data are essentially absent: no record reports a randomized comparator-arm effect for GDMT or idebenone; the single standard-of-care data point is idebenone-associated partial visual recovery in early-treated LHON patients, as reported within a review - the direct comparison that the SoC map calls for is a major evidence gap (42535808).", "Honest negative/absent findings: broadly acting mitochondrial interventions have repeatedly failed in sporadic disease (42782782); methylene blue and MitoQ did not prevent age-related bone loss in 18-month-old mice at any of four bone sites (38535998); autologous germline mitochondrial energy transfer failed to show clinical benefit, with only MST outcomes 'promising' but unconfirmed (39066614).", "The preclinical positive tier is broad but unconfirmed in humans: urolithin A in HFpEF models (42616901; 42432192), NR in LHN cell and mouse models (10.21203/rs.3.rs-8295635/v1), SkQ1 in vitro (39335534), luteolin (42013553) and Restorin NR (42582917) - all tier 4, with zero human efficacy data in these cells.", "Data-quality caveats that constrain the whole comparison: several records coded 'meta' are narrative reviews without pooled estimates (41594657; 42782782; 42273289; 41677699; 42489969), and all seven registry-linked trials show pipeline activity only with direction=unclear (NCT05168774; NCT07531251; NCT05162768; NCT05820152; NCT07406854; NCT05293626; NCT05590468; NCT05732051)."]}